		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2102000000000008"]
			description: [
				"A &eBasic Control Circuit&r is the logic chip behind every advanced machine. The Osmium Compressor makes them. From here, everything gets smarter."
				""
				"&e&lFour tiers, each built from the one below:&r"
				"&7- &fBasic&7 - osmium + enriched redstone"
				"&7- &fAdvanced&7 - basic + enriched alloy"
				"&7- &fElite&7 - advanced + reinforced alloy"
				"&7- &fUltimate&7 - elite + atomic alloy"
				""
				"&c&lThis is a gate, not just a component.&r The &eAE2 Inscriber&r in this pack is built around an &cAdvanced Control Circuit&r - so the digital age genuinely waits on the electric one. You cannot start AE2 until Mekanism is running properly."
				""
				"&e&lThe alloy ladder behind those tiers&r runs through the Metallurgic Infuser: &7Enriched Alloy&r (iron + infused redstone), then &7Reinforced&r (enriched + infused diamond), then &7Atomic&r (reinforced + infused refined obsidian). Build the infuser line once and every circuit tier becomes cheap."
				""
				"&8Automate basic circuits early. They are consumed by the dozen and hand-crafting them will become the thing you hate most about this chapter."
			]
			icon: "mekanism:basic_control_circuit"
			id: "210200000000000D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2102000000000110"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The first logic chip"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
